    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;Sometimes, implementer need to change the name of one form. It's convenient for implementer to rename it by form builder.</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Steps</span></h2><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">1. Chose the form</span></h3><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Chose the form which need to rename from the form builder dashboard. （For example, chose the first form)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-3-1_20-22-16.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">2. Goto the Form Detail</span></h3><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Click on the </span><em>eye</em> icon (or <em>pen</em> icon<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">) to enter the form detail page. If the status of the form is published, then click on </span><em>Edit</em> button<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"> to open the edit mode for the rename function to be available.</span></p><p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:width=\"700\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-3-1_20-36-14.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;<strong>Edit model</strong></span></p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">3. Rename the form</span></h3><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Double click on the form name, and input the new name.</span></p><p /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"ccb65479-1812-416f-a7d0-f62114768d6a\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Remember to save it after rename, otherwise the system won't change the form name.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:width=\"700\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-3-1_20-39-1.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: center;\">Rename form</strong></span></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"icon\">false</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0b744f92-0474-4511-ba50-ea4dc8343d16\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"style\">none</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"4084f2de-c0c2-4eeb-b02a-1184ccf78a4a\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Links</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Create a new Form\" ri:version-at-save=\"9\" /></ac:link></p><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Add Controls\" ri:version-at-save=\"7\" /></ac:link></p><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Edit a Published Form\" ri:version-at-save=\"9\" /></ac:link></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
