      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"RenameaForm-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> Sometimes, implementer need to change the name of one form. It's convenient for implementer to rename it by form builder.</span></p><h2 id=\"RenameaForm-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><h3 id=\"RenameaForm-1.Chosetheform\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Chose the form</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Chose the form which need to rename from the form builder dashboard. （For example, chose the first form) </span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-22-16.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488370941752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=643&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-22-16.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488370941752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115092280\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-1_20-22-16.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085378\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"42cd8919-09ce-423c-8711-0eb15fa830d5\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-22-16.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488370941752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1286&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-22-16.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488370941752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=643&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p><h3 id=\"RenameaForm-2.GototheFormDetail\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">2. Goto the Form Detail</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Click on the </span><em>eye</em> icon (or <em>pen</em> icon<span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">) to enter the form detail page. If the status of the form is published, then click on </span><em>Edit</em> button<span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> to open the edit mode for the rename function to be available.</span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-36-14.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488371791373&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=291\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-36-14.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488371791373&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115092450\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-1_20-36-14.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085378\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"89855b37-96bd-48be-b7f5-2bfdd9e13987\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-36-14.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488371791373&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=582 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-36-14.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488371791373&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=291 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> <strong>Edit model</strong></span></p><h3 id=\"RenameaForm-3.Renametheform\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">3. Rename the form</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Double click on the form name, and input the new name.</span></p><p /><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ccb65479-1812-416f-a7d0-f62114768d6a\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Remember to save it after rename, otherwise the system won't change the form name.</p></div></div><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-39-1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488371941802&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=291\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-39-1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488371941802&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115092473\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-1_20-39-1.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085378\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"6ab657d3-2709-49f1-9e28-3c3a6124e3fe\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-39-1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488371941802&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=582 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085378/image2017-3-1_20-39-1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488371941802&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=291 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> </span><strong style=\"text-align: center;\">Rename form</strong></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-cssliststyle=\"none\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"0b744f92-0474-4511-ba50-ea4dc8343d16\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><p><br/></p><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"4084f2de-c0c2-4eeb-b02a-1184ccf78a4a\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085179/Create+a+new+Form\" data-linked-res